### Order WebAPI Testing Endpoints

### 1. Health Check
GET https://localhost:7003/api/order/health

### 2. Get All Orders for a User
GET https://localhost:7003/api/order/1

### 3. Get Specific Order Details
GET https://localhost:7003/api/order/1/1001

### 4. Create Order from Cart (Main functionality)
POST https://localhost:7003/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "paymentMethod": "CreditCard",
  "preferredDeliveryDate": "2024-02-15T00:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Please deliver during business hours"
}

### 5. Cancel Order
PUT https://localhost:7003/api/order/1/1001/cancel

### 6. Update Order Status (Admin function)
PUT https://localhost:7003/api/order/1001/status?status=Processing

### 7. Update Order Status to Shipped
PUT https://localhost:7003/api/order/1001/status?status=Shipped

### 8. Update Order Status to Delivered
PUT https://localhost:7003/api/order/1001/status?status=Delivered

### 9. Test Invalid User ID
GET https://localhost:7003/api/order/-1

### 10. Test Invalid Order Creation (empty userId)
POST https://localhost:7003/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 0,
  "notes": "This should fail"
}

### 11. Test Invalid Status Update
PUT https://localhost:7003/api/order/1001/status?status=InvalidStatus